Some screenshots in docs/images contain SwissDial reference-text excerpts,
alongside model-generated transcripts, scores, and word-difference annotations.
They are cropped views of the benchmark UI, not unmodified dataset files.
Retain this attribution and the dataset's noncommercial restriction when
